{"title":"广东新一批12项基层改革创新经验 向全省复制推广","date":"2023-07-25","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\r\nmso-outline-level:2\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#2E2E2E;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">广东新一批<span lang=\"EN-US\">12</span>项基层改革创新经验<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;\r\nmso-outline-level:2\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:宋体;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;color:#2E2E2E;mso-font-kerning:0pt;mso-ligatures:\r\nnone\">向全省复制推广<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 2.25pt 24px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(27, 27, 27); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">　　近日，省委深改委印发《关于复制推广第三批基层改革创新经验的通知》（下称《通知》），将新一批<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">12</span>项基层改革创新经验向全省复制推广。</span></span></span><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(27, 27, 27); box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><o:p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 2.25pt 24px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; outline: none; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(27, 27, 27); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">　　《通知》指出，近年来全省各地区各部门坚持以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，坚持遵循顶层设计和摸着石头过河相结合，持续深化改革试点实验，探索形成一系列具有示范推广意义的改革创新成果。本次提出复制推广<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">12</span>项基层改革创新经验。</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0px 2.25pt 24px 80px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; clear: both; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 20px; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: rgb(27, 27, 27); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">具体包括：</span></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; font-size: 16px; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin: 10px 0px; padding: 0px; max-width: 100%; justify-content: flex-start; display: flex; flex-flow: row nowrap; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 12px; max-width: 100%; display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 0%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<p style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<svg style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" viewbox=\"0 0 1 1\"></svg></p>\r\n\t\t</section>\r\n\t\t<section style=\"margin: 50px 0px 0px -5px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 20px; max-width: 100%; display: inline-block; vertical-align: top; width: auto; align-self: flex-start; flex: 100 100 0%; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 0px 0px 1px; border-left-color: rgb(161, 213, 252); height: auto; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t\t<section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px